Error [E0204]: `total` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     total += 1
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: while something is being changed through the write-capability marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: pass the write-capability marker `&` (`&total`) only once, or copy first with `~total`
